seo_schema:
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Eldeco a Lucknow company?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Eldeco Housing & Industries Ltd, the listed company that runs the Eldeco business in Lucknow, is a Lucknow real estate developer listed on the BSE and NSE (IIFL company profile). The Eldeco name goes back to 1975, when Eldeco Construction Pvt Ltd was set up (IIFL company profile)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who owns Eldeco?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Pankaj Bajaj is the Chairman and Managing Director of Eldeco Housing & Industries Ltd (Eldeco investor call, 11 Feb 2026) and of the Eldeco Group (HDFC Capital–Eldeco announcement, 14 Apr 2025). As a listed company, its shareholding pattern is published on the BSE and NSE."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are Eldeco's current projects in Lucknow?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Under construction: Eldeco Trinity (Gomti Nagar Extension, due Sep 2028) and Eldeco Skywalk (IIM Road area, due Oct 2029). Launched in January 2026: Eldeco Solano Gardens (villas, plots and group housing). Recently completed: Eldeco East End at Shaurya (RERA completion 15 Mar 2026) and Eldeco Imperia Phase 2 on Kanpur Road (completion certificate in FY26) (RERA record, RERA record, Eldeco investor call, 11 Feb 2026, RERA record, FY26 results summary, 25 May 2026)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Eldeco Trinity built by Eldeco Housing & Industries?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The RERA promoter of Eldeco Trinity is Eldeco Inception Buildtech Private Limited (RERA record). Make sure your agreement and payment receipts name the same company as the RERA record."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the price of plots in Eldeco Solano Gardens?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "In its February 2026 investor call, Eldeco said plots there were priced at about ₹6,000 per sq ft (Eldeco investor call, 11 Feb 2026). Prices change — ask for the current price list and the RERA record before booking."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Eldeco financially stable?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Its own reported numbers for FY 2025-26: bookings of ₹743.9 crore, collections of ₹352.1 crore and net profit of ₹24.3 crore (FY26 results summary, 25 May 2026). In February 2026 it reported about ₹180 crore of cash against about ₹106 crore of debt, with much of the cash held in RERA project accounts (Eldeco investor call, 11 Feb 2026). Financial health helps, but always check your own project's RERA progress."
      }
    }
  ]
}
